{"ID":"20240515142925-0p211l6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142925-0p211l6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142925-0p211l6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143456-wx4ku5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143456-wx4ku5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143456-wx4ku5m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:516,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:516\u0026#125;","title":"109","type":"doc","updated":"20240515143456"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143456-wx4ku5m","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 721px;","id":"20240515143456-wx4ku5m","updated":"20240515143456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YL"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年約70，中等身材，背微凸 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/27"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診時長期服用Baby Aspirin導致輕微中風，左唇麻且左側無力，師先予小續命湯加減二劑，患者無大進步，二診時(2008/08/04)予炙甘草湯，病人服後狀況大有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三診時脈仍時一止，但有力許多，體力、胃口、睡眠皆好轉，左側身麻已退，大便由便秘改善為日一行；心口痛減少，仍有一點點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本次四診病人結代脈幾乎消失，排糞極多，手足溫熱，原本的左側無力已恢復正常，師再予十帖藥以鞏固療效，並囑可不用再來復診。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）體力：好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）昏眩：已無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）中風患側：全部恢復。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）大便：日一行，量極多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）睡眠：好，睡時身溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）手足：皆溫，額涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）頭痛：已無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右手脈微有代脈，左脈很好。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苔黃濕。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人進步很多，且穩定。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同二診方(2008/08/04炙甘草湯加減)，加川芎三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"予十付，每付九煮成三碗，早晚餐飯前服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎可活血，可走到腦部，又可增加血管彈性，不像Aspirin反而會導致腦出血中風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草湯既然中病，就要守方。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二診所開炙甘草湯並無攻下藥，連火麻仁都去掉了，但服後大便卻能暢行，這是因為心臟力量回復，進而使小腸蠕動速度加快，所以大便就因而通暢了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}